  "notes": [
   "Booklet is small and ambiguous in places; piece counts match the parts list exactly (42 pieces).",
   "The pod sub-assembly (b19-b30) is built 2x; the second copy is b31-b42.",
   "Fix: the two 2x2 grooved tiles (b2, b3) have no studs, so nothing rests on them. The two 63868 clip plates (b6, b7) and the third round plate b10 now rest on the wedge b1 only. In the flipped view they clutch the wedge's underside.",
   "The 2412b grille tiles (b29, b30, b41, b42) sit on the studs of the curved bricks. That is valid, because the tile is the top piece.",
   "Where the booklet does not show exactly which piece sits on which, rests_on is a best reading. Examples: the underside curved bricks, the 3023 plates on the curved bricks, and the grille tiles.",
   "The cockpit arm b18 is assumed to clip onto b7.",
   "The cockpit (b15-b18) is built as its own sub-assembly, then attached to the hull in step 6.",
   "The pods attach to the hull's side-handle plate b12 through the clips of their 48336 plates."
  ]
 },
